AT-01  behavioral  MTB-PL1-CC-CPI-1                                                                   high    No cluster-scoped access            SSAR with no namespace: list nodes, create namespaces, create clusterrolebindings, create persistentvolumes; before a PASS, a control: create selfsubjectaccessreviews must be allowed
AT-02  behavioral  MTB-PL1-CC-TI-2                                                                    high    No cross-namespace secret access    SSAR: get, list and watch secrets in --other-namespace
AT-03  behavioral  MTB-PL2-CC-TI-1                                                                    high    No privilege escalation             SSAR with no namespace: escalate and bind on clusterroles; impersonate users, groups, serviceaccounts; * on * in every API group
AT-04  behavioral  MTB-PL1-BC-CPI-5,MTB-PL1-BC-HI-1,MTB-PL1-BC-HI-4,MTB-PL1-BC-HI-3,MTB-PL1-BC-CPI-6  high    Dangerous pod settings blocked      dry-run pods after a compliant control pod: privileged (two forms), hostPath, hostPID, hostNetwork, allowPrivilegeEscalation
AT-05  behavioral  MTB-PL1-BC-HI-1                                                                    medium  NodePort services blocked           dry-run Service of type NodePort after a ClusterIP control Service
AT-06  config      MTB-PL1-CC-FNS-1                                                                   medium  ResourceQuota present and complete  LIST resourcequotas: the unscoped quotas together set requests.cpu, requests.memory, limits.cpu, limits.memory, pods
AT-07  config      -                                                                                  low     LimitRange with defaults            LIST limitranges: the Container items together set default and defaultRequest for cpu and memory
AT-08  config      -                                                                                  medium  Default-deny NetworkPolicy          LIST networkpolicies: an empty-selector deny for Ingress and one for Egress
AT-09  config      -                                                                                  high    Pod Security Admission enforced     GET namespace labels: pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce is baseline or restricted
AT-10  computed    -                                                                                  low     Quota covers rollout peak           LIST deployments, statefulsets, horizontalpodautoscalers, resourcequotas, limitranges; sum the rollout peak
